{"version":1,"content":"<p>剛於10月25日度過41歲生日的馬來西亞創作歌手兼音樂製作人張與辰，憑《中年好聲音3》躍升人氣王，不僅粉絲數量急增，就連工作量亦飆升。</p><p>不過忙碌背後，張與辰身體卻響起警號，繼6月突然身體不適要急送院治理後，早前經檢查後，又發現肝功能指數出現異</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T16:01:04.540346+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T15:36:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T15:58:22.193114+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T15:58:22.193114+00:00","content_hash":"1849b609c4bcb7819fc1d7753dfcaffb959eb805ccec714925e7545177ec6211","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}